# Normalize line endings to LF — in the repository AND in the working tree, on every OS.
# Waddle bind-mounts these files into Linux containers and pushes projects to Linux remotes,
# so a CRLF checkout on Windows would break shell scripts (#!/bin/sh), Dockerfiles and service
# configs. `text=auto` auto-detects binaries and leaves them untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
